  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Jade Pool blessed land cycles three days of bright sky and then one day of dark night. When night falls, some areas crack and split, revealing two deep pools that had been underground. One is canine pool, whose walls and bottom are formed from the polished teeth of an immemorial desolate beast qilin. Under moonlight it creates moon fangs.",
